%% What actually happens in a session. Note: no model is invoked in any Nexus box.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor DEV as Developer
    participant CC as Claude Code
    participant HK as hooks/
    participant NX as nexus (CLI)
    participant CTX as Context Engine
    participant DB as .nexus/nexus.db

    Note over DEV,CC: cd project && claude — nothing about this changes

    DEV->>CC: starts a session
    CC->>HK: SessionStart
    HK->>NX: nexus context --session --budget 800
    NX->>DB: baseline? scan or no-op rescan
    NX->>CTX: session package
    CTX->>DB: profile · open findings · durable facts
    CTX-->>NX: ~800 tokens
    NX-->>HK: package (exit 0 always)
    HK-->>CC: injected into turn 1

    Note over CC: the agent already knows what this project is,<br/>what is broken, and what previous sessions worked out

    DEV->>CC: "fix the payment idempotency bug"
    CC->>HK: UserPromptSubmit
    HK->>NX: nexus context --task "..." --budget 4000
    NX->>CTX: TaskRequest{Debug}
    CTX->>DB: seeds · impact · churn · findings · facts
    CTX-->>NX: 12 items, 3780 tok, ledger (61 considered)
    NX-->>CC: package
    Note right of HK: hard timeout, fail-open.<br/>nexus missing from PATH<br/>must not break the session.

    CC->>CC: reasons (the only probabilistic step)
    CC->>DEV: proposes an edit
    CC->>HK: PostToolUse(Edit)
    HK->>NX: nexus rescan --quiet
    NX->>DB: changed set, warm index

    CC->>HK: Stop ("done")
    HK->>NX: nexus verify --changed
    NX->>NX: compile · test · lint · diff · impact
    NX->>DB: append test_runs
    NX-->>CC: Verdict{Failed: 2 tests, PaymentServiceTest}
    Note over CC,DEV: "done" was a claim.<br/>Now it is checked.
    CC->>DEV: reports the real state

    opt agent learned something expensive
        CC->>NX: nexus_record_fact (evidence required)
        NX->>DB: facts, source=ai, candidate, conf <= 0.75
        Note over DB: validated by the next scan —<br/>invalidated when its evidence moves
    end
